WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.760
Level 5 Svartalf of the Nordic Alfar tunes

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:08.550
Level 1 Malus Token and Level 
4 Ljosalf of the Nordic Alfar!

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:15.280
The fickle god from the Polar World, show us 
your absolute power and laugh at the world!

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.960
Synchro Summon!

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.820
Descend, Loki, Lord of the Aesir!

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.710
No way!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:28.560
It can't be!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:34.010
The second god finally appeared!

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:46.720
I received a god, but I 
finally summoned my own god!

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:49.160
Now I have two immortal gods!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.690
Crow, it's over for you!

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:54.490
Loki, Lord of the Aesir 
attacks Black-Winged Dragon!

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.610
I still have all my strength!

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.580
I flip over my trap card Black Sonic!

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:14.690
When Black-Winged Dragon is 
on my field and you attack,

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:18.790
all your monsters in attack 
position are removed from play!

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:19.990
What?

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.710
The gods can't resurrect if 
they're removed from play!

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:25.960
What an impressive strategy!  
You're incredible, Crow!

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.130
I haven't forgotten about the 
second god from the start!

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:31.940
This is all my strength!

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.900
I sealed away two gods!

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:40.710
Your full strength is impressive, 
but now that I summoned Loki,

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:43.010
Lord of the Aesir, nothing 
can touch the gods.

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.120
What?

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.810
I activate Loki, Lord of the Aesir's effect!

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:53.430
When Loki attacks, one card in your Spell 
and Trap Card Zone is negated and destroyed!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.950
No way...

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:58.920
I'll bury your Black-Winged Dragon!

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:00.430
Vanity Bullet!

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.550
My other god can still attack!

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:22.600
Thor, Lord of the Aesir attacks 
Blizzard the Far North!

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:25.370
Thunder Pyle!

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.730
Whoa!  Crow's trap misfired!

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:35.740
Furthermore, two gods are 
conquering the field!

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:37.140
Oh no!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.190
After he made it this far...

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:39.550
Crow!

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:43.030
How's that, Crow?

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:48.680
Your full strength is nothing 
against these two gods.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:53.140
Besides, you have no monsters on your 
field and zero cards in your hand.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.590
And you only have 50 life points left.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.630
Admit that you're powerless!

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:01.500
My team is making the finals!

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:05.570
We will battle Team New World and Iliaster!

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:06.870
Damn...

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.380
I'm going to win!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.000
Nice, Brave!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.560
You're cool!

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:27.240
What are we going to do?  
No one is rooting for Crow.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.140
The five of us will!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.970
We'll cheer as hard as we can!

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.830
But he won't be able to hear us.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.940
It's like the victory lap.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.240
The battle hasn't been decided yet.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:55.590
Brave shouldn't be overconfident, but since 
he summoned two gods, victory is assured.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:00.460
Crow...

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.380
Is Crow going to lose?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.720
Oh no...

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.870
He still has 50 life points left.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.700
Crow won't give up!

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:15.630
But if he takes another attack from 
a god, forget about his life points!

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.440
Crow might not survive!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.070
Crow...

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:30.300
Riding Duels.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.410
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:40.210
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:05:01.480
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:11.590
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:17.830
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:23.770
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:29.540
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:35.150
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:41.520
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:47.330
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:53.630
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:59.940
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:30.100
Clash!  Destiny Depends on Black Wings!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.970
What's wrong, Crow?

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:39.320
If you can't punch, then surrender.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.710
If nothing changes, I'll lose.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.510
My turn!

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:52.350
Crow, show me if you can do anything!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:04.960
Brave!

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.470
Crow, do your best!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.080
Crow, do your best!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.420
Do your best!

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:15.170
Crow!

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:16.880
We're rooting for you!

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:18.860
What are you doing?

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:20.150
That's dangerous!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:23.190
Those kids!

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.460
Whoa!  The children were 
so excited by the battle

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:36.190
that they tried to climb over 
the fence, but they're safe now!

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.450
Those fools...

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:50.320
You have to follow the rules 
when you're watching a match!

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.620
But...

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:59.260
We wanted Crow to hear our cheers, 
so we wanted to get closer.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.480
You guys...

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:07.290
Those kids did that for you.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:11.340
I know.  That's why I won't give up!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.080
Brave!

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:19.020
All these cheers don't compare 
to those children's voices.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:20.630
Just like them.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.030
Do your best, Brave!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.960
Don't lose, brother!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.540
I activate Speed World 2's effect.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:44.680
By removing 7 Speed Counters, 
I get to draw one card!

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.280
I'll bet everything on this!

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:49.650
I draw!

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:57.150
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.210
I'll show you my all my final strength!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.880
He set his entire hand.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:08.590
But he has 50 life points and no monsters.

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:10.190
What can he do in this situation?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:11.980
Furthermore...

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.380
Don't you know?

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:19.000
If I get a Speed Spell on my next 
draw, I'll use Speed World 2's effect

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.620
to deal you 800 points 
of damage, and you lose!

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.350
I told you that I'm not giving up!

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.540
Crow isn't willing to lose.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.050
He's aiming for a comeback.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.740
But it all depends on what Brave does next.

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.670
Please don't draw a Speed Spell!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:42.030
It's the draw of destiny!

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:43.170
My turn!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:55.910
Whoa!  It looks like it's not a Speed Spell!

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:57.550
Thank goodness!

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:10.350
The gods are saying that they want 
to see all your final strength.

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.120
I don't need to panic.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:16.770
I only have to be cautious 
of those two set cards.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:18.520
However...

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:26.070
If I remove 10 Speed Counters, I can use 
an effect to destroy one of his set cards.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:27.830
But he knows that!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:33.360
If you activate a trap when Loki attacks,

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:38.610
Loki's effect negates that trap, 
and it will attack you directly.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.800
I see.  I now understand.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:47.750
Even though he'll lose, he wants 
to make me use 10 Speed Counters.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.490
That set card creates a more 
favorable situation for Yusei Fudo.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:55.110
Those two cards are a bluff.

00:10:57.830 --> 00:11:02.760
At this point, Speed Counters won't 
create advantages or disadvantages.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:07.650
You're trying to wound me with your 
final move, but you can't hurt me.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.040
I'll do what you want and use it!

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:13.450
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:18.570
By removing 10 Speed Counters, one 
card on the field is destroyed!

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:29.390
Crow's set card Black Wing is destroyed!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.910
I'll take all your life points!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.720
Loki, Lord of the Aesir attacks you directly!

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:39.260
Vanity Bullet!

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.460
It's over.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.320
Crow!

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:09.000
Crow!

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:12.970
I flip over my trap card Black Wing!

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:18.570
When your monster with 2000 
or more attack points attacks,

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:23.540
I remove a Blackwing in my graveyard 
from play to stop the attack!

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:27.220
Just in case, you set two 
copies of the same card.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.020
But that's worthless!  Did you 
forget about Loki's effect?

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:37.040
When Loki attacks, your spell or trap card's 
activation is negated and destroyed!

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.770
Loki, Lord of the Aesir's attack continues.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.230
It's over, Crow Hogan!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.550
Crow, do your best!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.520
As long as they keep cheering for 
me, I'll keep creating miracles!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.260
Then show me your miracle!

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:59.370
I activate Blackwing - Calima the 
Haze's effect from my graveyard!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:08.060
I see!  Even if he has no cards in his hand 
and zero set cards, he still has his graveyard!

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.040
It's an ambush!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:14.100
When I have no monsters during 
your turn's Battle Phase...

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:19.170
I can remove this card from play 
to Special Summon a Synchro Monster

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:23.080
from my graveyard until the 
end of the Battle Phase!

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:26.150
Return, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:37.510
In this situation, I knew you would 
have a graveyard monster's effect.

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:41.600
But Black-Winged Dragon 
has 2800 attack points.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.960
Loki has 3300 attack points.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:49.220
Nothing changes.  Since you only have 50 
life points, you're still going to lose.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:54.680
You're bluffing to stop me from attacking, 
but I'm one step ahead of you.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:56.970
Say sorry to your kids!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:13:59.740
I'm taking your life points!

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:01.250
Vanity Bullet!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.460
No, I'm taking yours!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:10.900
I activate the trap card 
Black Wing from my graveyard!

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:15.840
You're activating a trap from your graveyard?

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:17.210
From the graveyard?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.950
A trap from the graveyard?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.650
A trap from the graveyard?  Incredible!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:25.840
He activated a trap card from the graveyard!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:31.810
That card...  I just 
destroyed that trap card!

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:37.050
That's right.  Black Wing shows its true 
value when there are two copies in the graveyard.

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:41.570
By removing these two cards from play, we 
both destroy one of our Synchro Monsters!

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:47.200
When Loki is destroyed, you take damage 
equal to its 3300 attack points!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:47.970
What?

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:51.760
Thanks for sending two Black 
Wing cards to the graveyard!

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:55.530
I completely fell for your strategy?

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:56.490
Incredible!

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.600
Crow is making a huge comeback!

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.390
No one thinks about using 
a trap from the graveyard!

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:02.160
Yeah!

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.610
Impressive, Crow!

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:05.380
So that's what you were aiming for!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.320
Nice, Crow!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.410
This is all my strength!

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:27.370
I can't believe you faced two gods 
with zero cards in your hand.

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:31.430
In that case, I'll answer 
you with all my strength!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.070
Do your best, Brave!

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.290
Lend me your power!

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:44.070
I flip over my trap card 
Dromi the Sacred Shackles!

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:49.130
When a god is on the field and an effect 
makes your monster leave the field...

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:52.850
...you take damage equal to the difference 
in Loki and your monster's attack points!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:56.540
There's a 500-point difference between Loki 
and Black-Winged Dragon's attack points!

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:59.710
You take 500 points of damage!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:00.640
What?

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:12.040
What's going on?

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:15.020
Both Crow and Brave's effects work!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.680
That means...

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:17.810
Mutual destruction!

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:27.690
I saw your full strength and how 
much you care about the children.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.540
It seems we're similar.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:37.630
But the gods resurrect again.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:04.500
The clash between the tricksters 
ended in a shocking draw!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.770
Crow!

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:15.110
The battle isn't over yet.

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:16.570
Harald is tough.

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:17.900
So is Yusei.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:26.720
The last wheelers Harald and 
Yusei wait in their pits.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:33.850
They both start with 4000 life points, but Team 
Ragnarok has already summoned two gods on their field.

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:39.380
Team 5D's will start at an 
overwhelming disadvantage!

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:47.650
Yusei, we'll finally find out if destiny 
entrusted the future of the world

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:54.520
to the Rune Eyes or to the 
marks of the Crimson Dragon.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.180
I don't care about destiny!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:04.520
I'll just drive on this lane that 
the bond with my friends created!

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:08.140
Our answer is inside speed!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.580
We're counting on you, Yusei!

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:14.310
It's up to you, Harald!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:25.530
You were right, Jack.

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:29.420
Yusei, be careful of the gods' attacks.

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:34.030
It's the climax of the semifinals!

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:37.740
The two aces will clash 
to determine the outcome!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.890
Will Yusei Fudo be victorious?

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:44.110
Or will it be Harald?

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:46.980
Duel!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.540
My turn!

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:54.970
I summon Cosmic Compass in defense position!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:04.820
When Cosmic Compass is successfully summoned,

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:09.210
I can Special Summon a Compass Token 
for every monster that you have!

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:13.310
I Special Summon two Compass 
Tokens in defense position!

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:18.500
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.570
Yusei is incredible!

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:27.270
He instantly summoned three monsters!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:31.490
He's forming a tight 
defense against the gods!

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:37.040
I can't believe they managed 
to make Harald have to fight.

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:42.520
I want to say that I'm 
sorry, but they're very...

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:43.680
...strong.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.780
I know.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.120
But they have a bad match-up.

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:52.010
No one has ever survived 
to the end against Harald.

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:56.960
Even we can't reach Harald's level.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.120
My turn!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.840
I flip over my Continuous Trap Monster Chain!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:10.510
I can negate a Battle Phase 
for every monster on my field!

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:15.290
I have three monsters, so we 
can't attack for three turns.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:20.060
Loki's trap destruction effect 
activates when it attacks.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.290
That means he can't use it anymore.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:28.130
You think that you've sealed the gods, 
but these cheap tricks don't work!

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:29.160
What?

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.840
I summon the Tuner Monster 
Valkyrie of the Nordic Ascendant!

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.790
A Tuner Monster?

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:44.000
When Valkyrie of the Nordic Ascendant 
is successfully summoned...

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.970
I can send two cards in 
my hand to the graveyard

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.930
to Special Summon two Einherjar 
Tokens in defense position.

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.630
It can't be!

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.370
Yes, it can.

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:04.380
Level 2 Valkyrie of the Nordic Ascendant 
tunes two Level 4 Einherjar Tokens!

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:09.770
The almighty king that rules 
the northern polar sky!

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:15.080
It's time to control the gods of the 
Polar World and show your authority!

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.080
Synchro Summon!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.000
Rule the heavens and earth!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:24.050
The ultimate god, Odin, Father of the Aesir!

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:30.650
What's that?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.730
It's the third god.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.920
